      "en": "The pain of having to press that slippery keyboard with just my nails..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "키보드에 손톱을 희생하고 누르는 나의 심정",
      "en": "Sacrificing my nails just to press the keys..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "원하는대로 움직이지 않지만 끝까지 포기하지 않는 열정",
      "en": "Even when it doesn't move the way I want, I never give up."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "할수있어?!!?!!?!?!",
      "en": "Could you do that?!!?!!?!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 내 게임이 온세상에",
      "en": "And then my gameplay"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "공개가 되어버린것임",
      "en": "ended up being shown to the whole world."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니",
      "en": "Also..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "게임닉이",
      "en": "my in-game nickname..."
    },
    {
  "type": "fan",
  "ko": "랜덤이지??",
  "en": "It's random, right??"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "맞아",
  "en": "Yeah."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "내가 지은것이 아니긴한데",
  "en": "I didn't come up with it myself,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "바스티온이랑 잘어울려서 냅뒀어",
  "en": "but it suits Bastion, so I just left it."
},
{
  "type": "fan",
  "ko": "나도 예전에 그래서 화끈한늑대였음",
  "en": "Mine used to be 'Fiery Wolf.'"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "화끈하시네",
  "en": "Sounds pretty fiery."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "겜하다 본거같은데",
  "en": "I think I've seen you in-game."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "트롤했던거 너였냐 화늑????",
  "en": "Were you the one trolling, Fiery Wolf????"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "칵그냥",
  "en": "Just—"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋ",
  "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋ"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "나 레벨 올려서",
  "en": "If I level up"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "프로게이머랑 대결",
  "en": "and play against a pro gamer..."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "이런거 하면",
  "en": "or something like that,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "ㅎㅎ",
  "en": "ㅎㅎ"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "지겠죠",
  "en": "I'd probably lose."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "근데 나 요즘",
  "en": "But these days,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "신기한게",
  "en": "there's something interesting."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "잠이 들때 보통",
  "en": "Normally, when you fall asleep,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "잠이 언제들었지 하면서 자잖아",
  "en": "you don't really know when you actually fell asleep, right?"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "근데",
  "en": "But"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "나는",
  "en": "for me,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "어 3초뒤에 잠든다",
  "en": "I can tell, 'Oh, I'm going to fall asleep in three seconds.'"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "직감적으로",
  "en": "Instinctively,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "느껴져",
  "en": "I can feel it."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "근데 그걸 못느끼면",
  "en": "But if I don't get that feeling,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "잠이 안와",
  "en": "I can't fall asleep."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "그러다",
  "en": "Then,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "내가 노력해서 그환경을 만들면 바로 자고",
  "en": "if I intentionally recreate that feeling, I fall asleep right away."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "뭔가 자기전에 상상이나 생각이 들잖아",
  "en": "You know how you start imagining things before you fall asleep?"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "누워서",
  "en": "When you're lying down,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "근데 무의식중에 그 상상의 소리가 현실처럼 크게 들리기 시작하면",
  "en": "once the sounds in those imaginations unconsciously start sounding as loud as real life,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "잠이 들어",
  "en": "that's when I fall asleep."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "신기하지",
  "en": "Isn't that fascinating?"
},
{
  "type": "fan",
  "ko": "여기가 꿈이게 현실이게",
  "en": "Is this a dream or reality?"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "꿈인것같은데?",
  "en": "I think it's a dream."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "Y/n랑 얘기하는게 너무 좋은꿈같아서~?",
  "en": "Talking with Y/n feels like such a nice dream~"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "깨고싶지가 않네 ㅎ",
  "en": "I don't want to wake up. ㅎ"
},
{
  "type": "fan",
  "ko": "하연아 근데 일어나봐야할듯 너지금코곤대",
  "en": "Hayeon, I think you need to wake up... you're snoring right now."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "난 코 안골아",
  "en": "I don't snore."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "잠꼬대한대",
  "en": "But apparently I talk in my sleep."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "자는내내",
  "en": "The whole time I was sleeping,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "Y/n 이름만 불렀다던데?",
  "en": "they said I kept calling Y/n's name."
},
{
  "type": "fan",
  "ko": "잠꼬대나 코골면 살 쪘다는 소리래",
  "en": "They say if you snore or talk in your sleep, it means you've gained weight."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "야야",
  "en": "Hey, hey."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "서윗한 말 하고있잖아",
  "en": "I was saying something sweet."
},
{
  "type": "fan",
  "ko": "하연이는 반장이나 부반장 한 적 있어?",
  "en": "Have you ever been a class president or vice president?"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "아픈상처 건드리지 마세요",
  "en": "Please don't reopen old wounds."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "이거 썰 안풀었나!",
  "en": "Didn't I ever tell this story?"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "?",
  "en": "?"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "아니",
  "en": "No..."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "초등학교 저학년때인데",
  "en": "It was when I was in the lower grades of elementary school."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "그때 거의 10명이 출전했단말이지",
  "en": "There were about ten candidates."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "근데 친구가",
  "en": "Then one of my friends said,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "너도 손 들어!!",
  "en": "\"You should run too!!\""
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "내가 뽑아줄겡!!",
  "en": "\"I'll vote for you!!\""
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "이러는거야",
  "en": "That's what they told me."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "그래서 애들다",
  "en": "Since everyone else was basically"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "함함 아님말고",
  "en": "\"Why not? If it happens, it happens.\""
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "이런느낌이여서",
  "en": "kind of in that mood,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "나도 저도 할래유~",
  "en": "I was like, \"Okay, I'll do it too~\""
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "했지?",
  "en": "So I did."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "이제 개표를 하는데",
  "en": "Then they started counting the votes,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "다 거기서 거기긴 했는데",
  "en": "and everyone had about the same number..."
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "나는 한표가 나온거야 ㅎㅎ",
  "en": "but I got one vote. ㅎㅎ"
},
{
  "type": "fan",
  "ko": "너 자신?",
