},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "뭐 쨋든 깊은 상처를 주고",
  "en": "Anyway, they left me with a deep emotional wound,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "아무렇지않게 있더라고!!!",
  "en": "and acted like nothing had happened!!!"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "그 이후로",
  "en": "After that,"
},
{
  "type": "hayeon",
  "ko": "굳이 나서서 어디",
